### Embeddings from Raw Text
POST http://localhost:7071/api/embeddings
Content-Type: application/json

{"rawText": "Enter raw text here for embedding generation."}


### Embeddings from File
POST http://localhost:7071/api/embeddings-from-file
Content-Type: application/json

{"fileName": "README.md"}

### Embeddings from Url
POST http://localhost:7071/api/embeddings-from-url
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azure/azure-functions-openai-extension/main/README.md"}